entries[444077] = { ["name"] = "Writhing Hide", ["text"] = "2 sec cast\nReagents:\nWrithing Sample (5), Carapace-Backed Hide\nOptional Reagents:\nA potent reagent made using Nerubian techniques, it exudes a menacing aura.\nProfession Trainer:\nKhaz Algar Leatherworking (25)\nCost:\n130\n\nWrithing Hide\nCrafting Reagent\n\"Crafted by players with the Leatherworking skill. Can be bought and sold on the Auction House.\"" }
