entries[444264] = { ["name"] = "Digestive Venom", ["text"] = "6 yd range\nInstant 1.5 min cooldown\nInject an enemy with digestive venom, dealing 2330 Nature damage over 20 sec. While active, your attacks and abilities against the target restore 121 health. Cannot occur more than every 1 sec.\n\nOverhealing from this effect permanently increases your maximum health by the same amount, becoming an absorb shield upon leaving combat." }
