entries[444336] = { ["name"] = "Algari Competitor's Medallion", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 2\nReagents:\nBoundless Cipher (2), Shadow Ink (3), Apricate Ink (3), Competitor's Heraldry (#255) (3)\nOptional Reagents:\nVendor:\nHotharn\nZone:\nDornogal\nCost:\n7500\nRecipe:\nPurchasable on the Auction House\n\nAlgari Competitor's Medallion\nBinds when equipped\nUnique-Equipped: Gladiator's Medallions (1)Trinket\n+2,024 [Agility or Strength or Intellect] Use: Removes all movement impairing effects and all effects which cause loss of control of your character.\n70\n\nGladiator's Distinction (0/2)\nGladiator's Emblem\nGladiator's Medallion" }
