entries[444764] = { ["name"] = "Reaver's Glaive", ["text"] = "Instant\nConsuming [ Havoc : 6 /\n\nVengeance\n20 ] Soul Fragments or casting The Hunt converts your next Throw Glaive into Reaver's Glaive.\n\nReaver's Glaive :\nThrow a glaive enhanced with the essence of consumed souls at your target, dealing (345% of Attack Power) Physical damage and ricocheting to 2 additional enemies.\n\nBegins a well-practiced pattern of glaivework, enhancing your next [ Havoc : Chaos Strike / Fracture / Shear ] and [ Havoc : Blade Dance /\n\nVengeance\nSoul Cleave ]\nThe enhanced ability you cast first deals 10% increased damage, and the second deals 20% increased damage." }
